<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.53 pct, 3-mo 21.11 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.53 pct, 3-mo 21.11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) were mixed on Friday, dipping for one-month and remaining steady for the three-month maturity, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 21.53 percent, down 0.02, while the three-month rate at 21.11 percent, unchanged, the NBH said on.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
